{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "zh-Hans",
  "language_raw": "Simp_Chinese",
  "source": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/c01.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/c01.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "c01_school_03",
      "hash64": "2EFC1A76716B2CCA",
      "text": "学院里超出名的地狱般的楼梯，\\n爬起来超累人的对吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "c01_school_05",
      "hash64": "2EFC1476716B2298",
      "text": "桌台市啊，\\n是学校和文化的城镇！\\r\\n它就像桌台一样宽阔！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "c01_school_09",
      "hash64": "2EFC1076716B1BCC",
      "text": "学校里有各种各样的人，\\n还有各种各样的宝可梦哦！\\r\\n你也是各种各样的其中之一吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "c01_school_16",
      "hash64": "2EF915767168EE74",
      "text": "天星队的人\\n有点可怕呢，对吧～",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "c01_school_17",
      "hash64": "2EF916767168F027",
      "text": "听说天星队的人每天晚上\\n都骑着奇怪的车飙来飙去。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "c01_northwest_06",
      "hash64": "7D8AA2BF4AF114E1",
      "text": "在学院里，你们可以选择\\n自己喜欢的课来上，是吧？\\r\\n最近的学校真是不一样呢～",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "c01_northwest_10",
      "hash64": "7D871EBF4AEDFEBE",
      "text": "喂喂？本校的学生\\n都是好孩子，真是帮大忙了。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "c01_northwest_16",
      "hash64": "7D8720BF4AEE0224",
      "text": "不愧是帕底亚最大的都市！\\n我彻底迷路啦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "c01_northwest_17",
      "hash64": "7D8721BF4AEE03D7",
      "text": "地图上绿色的方位是北哦。\\c\\n试一下按压Ｒ摇杆\\n把北面固定朝上如何？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "c01_northwest_27",
      "hash64": "7D8411BF4AEBB2D0",
      "text": "宝可梦联盟\\n在隧道的尽头吧？\\c\\n在那里可以参加能够\\n成为冠军级的测验，对不对？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "c01_northwest_28",
      "hash64": "7D8420BF4AEBCC4D",
      "text": "我在宝可梦联盟\\n考完了面试测验！\\r\\n面试官……是个可怕的人～",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "c01_northwest_32",
      "hash64": "7D8094BF4AE8A892",
      "text": "城镇外面有许多\\n我没见过的宝可梦对吧～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "c01_northwest_40",
      "hash64": "7D7D0CBF4AE58BA3",
      "text": "那个叫莉普的超级模特啊！\\n我听说她跟学校里的\\r\\n某位老师是发小呢！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "c01_park_01",
      "hash64": "08DF734206A833F0",
      "text": "这前面的岩山错综复杂！\\n很容易迷路，你要当心。\\c\\n穿过岩山之后\\n就是艺术的城镇，深钵镇哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "c01_park_07",
      "hash64": "08DF794206A83E22",
      "text": "是知名的博士解明了\\n宝可梦的太晶化现象吧？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "c01_park_08",
      "hash64": "08DF7C4206A8433B",
      "text": "听说那位博士……\\n在帕底亚巨坑进行着不得了的研究。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "c01_park_10",
      "hash64": "08DC0E4206A5527A",
      "text": "好～好地睡饱觉的话，\\n就能等到去学校的那天咯。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "c01_park_11",
      "hash64": "08DC0F4206A5542D",
      "text": "我也想快点\\n去学院～上课～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "c01_park_16",
      "hash64": "08DC084206A54848",
      "text": "时间会流逝……\\n天气会变化……\\c\\n听说野生宝可梦的行动\\n会随着时间和天气改变。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "c01_park_20",
      "hash64": "08D8884206A238F1",
      "text": "池子好大～！\\c\\n我好想像鲤鱼王那样\\n漂在水面上哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "c01_park_25",
      "hash64": "08D88B4206A23E0A",
      "text": "学校的老师\\n会被起一些外号，对吧？\\c\\n比如“阿朔”啦，“赛吉兄”啦～之类的，\\n我听到学生在聊天时这么叫哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "c01_park_29",
      "hash64": "08D87F4206A229A6",
      "text": "不同的宝可梦，\\n也会有各自学不会的招式呢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "c01_park_38",
      "hash64": "08D57A42069FEB50",
      "text": "我倒是想要太晶珠，\\n然而我成绩不够好……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "c01_park_39",
      "hash64": "08D57B42069FED03",
      "text": "只有优秀的学生\\n才能获得太晶珠哦。\\r\\n因为它的力量实在太强了。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "c01_center_south_01",
      "hash64": "D6E7A27424DC26F1",
      "text": "这里是桌台市，\\n是帕底亚最大的城镇哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "c01_center_south_15",
      "hash64": "D6EB227424DF3648",
      "text": "萨萨的家政课\\n非常有用哦～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "c01_center_south_16",
      "hash64": "D6EB257424DF3B61",
      "text": "蕾荷老师的历史课\\n真的非常有趣哦～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "c01_center_south_31",
      "hash64": "D6E49A7424D9E382",
      "text": "今天要去\\n哪家三明治店吃饭呢？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "c01_center_south_32",
      "hash64": "D6E4997424D9E1CF",
      "text": "同样的店在不同的地方\\n贩卖的商品也会有些许不同呢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "c01_center_south_44",
      "hash64": "D6DA257424D0C82E",
      "text": "城镇里的宝可梦\\n基本都是他人的搭档，\\r\\n所以不能捕捉哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "label": "c01_center_south_93",
      "hash64": "D6D0187424C85D92",
      "text": "我的宝可梦\\n对声音很敏感哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "label": "c01_center_south_94",
      "hash64": "D6D0137424C85513",
      "text": "即使是同一种宝可梦，\\n性格、特性和实力也会不同呢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "label": "c01_center_south_100",
      "hash64": "10D3015AA757FDB5",
      "text": "帕底亚的雨又不冷，\\n而且很快就停了，我才不打伞呢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "label": "c01_center_north_33",
      "hash64": "760EED392C2EE996",
      "text": "我的儿子好像\\n加入了天星队哦～\\r\\n那应该是很快乐的社团吧～",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "label": "c01_center_north_40",
      "hash64": "761272392C32016C",
      "text": "中央广场的对战场！\\c\\n在那里会受到大家瞩目，\\n没自信的话根本不敢使用，对吧？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "label": "c01_center_north_41",
      "hash64": "761273392C32031F",
      "text": "听说在别的地区，\\n冠军只有１个人！\\c\\n不过在帕底亚，\\n冠军级的却有好几个人，很厉害吧！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "label": "c01_center_north_54",
      "hash64": "7615F4392C351429",
      "text": "我不喜欢网上购物……\\n还是想看过实物之后再买。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "label": "c01_center_north_82",
      "hash64": "75E96C392C0EF226",
      "text": "你知道吗？最多可以\\n带６只宝可梦和你同行哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "label": "c01_center_north_83",
      "hash64": "75E96D392C0EF3D9",
      "text": "带不走的宝可梦\\n会被送到盒子里吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "label": "c01_center_north_91",
      "hash64": "75ECEF392C120696",
      "text": "到处捡宝可梦的掉落物，\\n再用交换得来的ＬＰ支付……\\r\\n这样的话，就算没钱我也能买到想要的东西！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "c01_center_north_94",
      "hash64": "75ECF4392C120F15",
      "text": "桌台市～是学问的城镇～♪\\n学院～我的母校～啦啦啦～♪",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "c01_stairs_03",
      "hash64": "0AE4BF2F2473DF1C",
      "text": "学校入口大厅的书架上那些书啊，\\n是可以随意阅读的哦！\\r\\n对于喜欢看书的人来说简直太幸福了～",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "c01_stairs_08",
      "hash64": "0AE4CA2F2473F1CD",
      "text": "我是学院的毕业生！\\n你们现在还在继续寻宝吗？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "label": "c01_stairs_22",
      "hash64": "0AEB502F2479412D",
      "text": "在学院是没有年龄限制的！\\n听说就算是老奶奶也可以入学！\\r\\n……我干脆也重新学习吧？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "label": "c01_square_01",
      "hash64": "A76B1F56A83A18B9",
      "text": "这前面是西门哦，\\n要去圆模镇的话就走西门！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "label": "c01_square_02",
      "hash64": "A76B1C56A83A13A0",
      "text": "西门在那边那条街！\\n途中会路过罐头店。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "label": "c01_square_03",
      "hash64": "A76B1D56A83A1553",
      "text": "这前边没路了！\\n只有九八酒吧哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "label": "c01_square_14",
      "hash64": "A76EA056A83D29C3",
      "text": "来做课外活动的准备吧！\\n信使鸟包包在哪里来着？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "label": "c01_square_15",
      "hash64": "A76E9F56A83D2810",
      "text": "信使鸟包包有几家店铺，\\n你往南走的话很快就能看到了。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "label": "c01_square_16",
      "hash64": "A76EA256A83D2D29",
      "text": "我只要看到宝可梦中心就感到放心，\\n……那里播放的音乐也很棒。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "label": "c01_square_17",
      "hash64": "A76EA156A83D2B76",
      "text": "只要是去过１次的宝可梦中心，\\n就可以坐飞翔出租车立马返回哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "label": "c01_southeast_04",
      "hash64": "7325B69DA7C89897",
      "text": "城镇和都市\\n有什么不同呢……面积大小？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "label": "c01_southeast_05",
      "hash64": "7325B59DA7C896E4",
      "text": "在帕底亚地区有３个\\n叫做“什么什么市”的都市！\\r\\n其中１个就是这个桌台市。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "label": "c01_southeast_08",
      "hash64": "7325AA9DA7C88433",
      "text": "我听说这附近\\n在卖稀有的三明治呢！\\r\\n……在哪儿呢？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "label": "c01_southeast_17",
      "hash64": "7322A79DA7C64943",
      "text": "三明治好好吃～！\\n我每天都想吃～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "label": "c01_southeast_18",
      "hash64": "7322B49DA7C65F5A",
      "text": "哦呵呵！\\n下次一起做饭吧？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "label": "c01_southeast_27",
      "hash64": "731F279DA7C339EC",
      "text": "北边是鳞次栉比的住宅街！\\c\\n我听说，如果你就住在桌台市，\\n学校是不会允许你住学生宿舍的。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 12,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "label": "c01_southeast_40",
      "hash64": "7333AA9DA7D4C18F",
      "text": "光是看别人带着宝可梦一起走的样子，\\n我都觉得好治愈哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "label": "c01_southeast_43",
      "hash64": "7333AB9DA7D4C342",
      "text": "三明治真好吃！\\n尤其是这家店的更好吃！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 59,
      "label": "c01_southeast_45",
      "hash64": "7333A59DA7D4B910",
      "text": "在信使鸟包包买手机壳，\\n就能改变手机洛托姆的外观哦！\\r\\n嗯～到底要选哪个呢……好烦恼！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 60,
      "label": "c01_southwest_06",
      "hash64": "3E6DD937806A447F",
      "text": "等我哪天捉住宝可梦了，\\n就要当上冠军级～！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 61,
      "label": "c01_southwest_12",
      "hash64": "3E6AD33780680476",
      "text": "学校里是不是流行星形的墨镜啊？\\n我看到成群结队的人戴着那个。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 62,
      "label": "c01_southwest_19",
      "hash64": "3E6ADA378068105B",
      "text": "不同城镇的对战场外观也不同，\\n比如颜色之类的。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 63,
      "label": "c01_southwest_23",
      "hash64": "3E74E437807075DE",
      "text": "宝可梦中心的姐姐每次都会\\n在回复的时候教我一些小知识。\\r\\n……难道只有我是特别的吗！？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 27,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 64,
      "label": "c01_southwest_29",
      "hash64": "3E74DA37807064E0",
      "text": "我让帕奇利兹携带\\n我在信使鸟包包买到的道具了！\\c\\n根据携带的道具，\\n还能有各种各样的加强效果呢！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 65,
      "label": "c01_southwest_31",
      "hash64": "3E715E37806D5C55",
      "text": "先制之爪！让宝可梦携带的话，\\n有时会发生开心的事！\\r\\n那里的红色商店在卖哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 66,
      "label": "c01_southwest_36",
      "hash64": "3E715737806D5070",
      "text": "从西门出去一～直走，\\n就能到圆模镇哦！\\r\\n现在正是丰收祭的季节呢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 67,
      "label": "c01_southwest_53",
      "hash64": "3E786C37807392CD",
      "text": "青铜钟真迷人……\\c\\n它偶尔会愿意让我进到钟里。\\n神奇的是，我只要一进去就会感到内心平静。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 68,
      "label": "c01_southwest_60",
      "hash64": "3E825B37807BCA6F",
      "text": "我迷路啦。\\n我还是看看地图App吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 69,
      "label": "c01_southwest_61",
      "hash64": "3E825A37807BC8BC",
      "text": "只要吃了这里的料理，\\n你就会感到充满蛋蛋力哦！\\c\\n这样在野餐时就比较容易\\n找到宝可梦的蛋了。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 70,
      "label": "c01_northeast_04",
      "hash64": "4F8F0471D0339599",
      "text": "你可以在招式学习器机\\n把宝可梦的掉落物兑换为ＬＰ哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 71,
      "label": "c01_northeast_08",
      "hash64": "4F8F1071D033A9FD",
      "text": "最近的机器动～不动就讲话！\\n就连招式学习器机也会发出声音，对吧？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 72,
      "label": "c01_northeast_09",
      "hash64": "4F8F0F71D033A84A",
      "text": "帕奇利兹的特性是逃跑！\\n它很擅长从野生的宝可梦手中逃走哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 73,
      "label": "c01_northeast_23",
      "hash64": "4F961571D039D12A",
      "text": "最近的自动售货机\\n还能用ＬＰ来买饮料呢。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 74,
      "label": "c01_northeast_24",
      "hash64": "4F961071D039C8AB",
      "text": "学校的楼梯实在太长了，\\n因此被称为地狱的楼梯呢。\\r\\n上下学的学生们着实辛苦了。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 75,
      "label": "c01_northeast_37",
      "hash64": "4F929171D036BB07",
      "text": "野生的宝可梦睡觉的时候就是良机！\\n可以趁它不注意先发制人！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 76,
      "label": "c01_northeast_38",
      "hash64": "4F928671D036A856",
      "text": "我一看到宝可梦睡觉的模样\\n就忍不住拍照，根本停不下来！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 77,
      "label": "c01_northeast_47",
      "hash64": "4F819171D02847D4",
      "text": "新任校长好像是克拉韦尔吧？\\n他应该是大约１年半之前就任的。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 78,
      "label": "c01_northeast_54",
      "hash64": "4F7E0E71D0253364",
      "text": "担任学生会长的\\n小妮莫是个好孩子呢。\\r\\n每次路过遇到她，她都会跟我打招呼。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 79,
      "label": "c01_northeast_71",
      "hash64": "4F851771D02B615D",
      "text": "遇到优美的景色，\\n就用相机App拍下照片吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 80,
      "label": "c01_other_01_01",
      "hash64": "EE1CAC64C5141708",
      "text": "你也喜欢\\n待在屋顶上放松吗？\\r\\n不过要小心别掉下去哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 81,
      "label": "c01_center_north_99",
      "hash64": "75ECF7392C12142E",
      "text": "在这家店可以买到\\n学校指定包包的不同颜色款哦。\\r\\n我要选哪个颜色呢～？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 82,
      "label": "c01_center_north_100",
      "hash64": "B8836226098752B3",
      "text": "我要去美发沙龙换个发型，\\n你就在这附近打发一下时间吧～",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 83,
      "label": "c01_center_north_101",
      "hash64": "B883612609875100",
      "text": "有些发型的名字听起来\\n像是宝可梦的招式。\\r\\n比如偏分啦，吉布森盘发啦……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 84,
      "label": "c01_center_north_102",
      "hash64": "B883642609875619",
      "text": "我要去眼镜乡买副眼镜，\\n实现自己人生首次的戴眼镜亮相！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 85,
      "label": "c01_center_north_103",
      "hash64": "B883632609875466",
      "text": "我想戴上时髦的帽子！\\n但也想好好秀发型！\\r\\n……我还是先去了店里再烦恼吧。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 86,
      "label": "c01_center_north_104",
      "hash64": "B88366260987597F",
      "text": "体寒的人就要穿厚厚的袜子！\\n这家店里有各种各样的款式哦。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 87,
      "label": "c01_square_28",
      "hash64": "A7642A56A8340CBC",
      "text": "水果、蔬菜……\\n连米饭都有……！？\\c\\n我要在罐头王囤好食材，\\n尽情制作三明治！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
